{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>灣仔警區特別職務隊於昨午（18日）在區內展開代號「虎尾」掃黃行動，突擊搜查皇后大道東、灣仔道、駱克道及蘭芳道多個樓上單位，拘捕11名年齡介乎19歲至50歲內地女子，涉嫌違反逗留條件。所有被捕人現正被扣留調查，稍後將交由相關部門跟進。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:44:08.583657+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T03:06:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T13:51:52.755120+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:37:33.497920+00:00","content_hash":"75d128879a06ff37a5b6cad481f9b9845c69e53503458ec6dc583a793396c043","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}